    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pairs that negate or choose",
     "texto": [
      "**Hverken … eller** = neither… nor: **Hverken Anna eller Peter kom.** = Neither Anna nor Peter came.",
      "**Enten … eller** = either… or: **Enten tager vi toget, eller også kører vi.** = Either we take the train or we drive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Adverbs in the middle",
     "texto": [
      "**Nok** (probably), **ikke** (not), **aldrig** (never), **endnu** (yet): they go after the conjugated verb in the main clause, and before it in the subordinate clause: **Hun har nok glemt det.** = She has probably forgotten it.",
      "In a subordinate clause: **fordi hun nok har glemt det** (because she has probably forgotten it)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
